    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udca1 TWENTYONE \ud83c\udca1</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>The ultimate gamble</strong> \u2014 <strong>your life on the line.</strong> \ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t <strong>luck</strong>. This isn\u2019t <strong>skill</strong>. This is <strong>survival</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face merciless opponents, each with their own twisted rules and dark pasts. Every match is a battle where the stakes are nothing less than your existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win or lose, there are no second chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Deadly <strong>new rules</strong> with every challenger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc Dark, twisted <strong>stories behind every face</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf A high-stakes game where <strong>losing means losing everything</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the guts to play? Or will the game take everything from <strong>you</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TWENTYONE \u2014 Bet your life. Play or perish. \ud83c\udfb2\ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you sign in, you can't turn back.<br>I have to tell you that this <strong>isn't a regular TwentyOne Competition.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733940/extras/d1831750a7846e7f7b838648d8a73da7.avif?t=1752184477\" width=307 height=355 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733940/extras/cca299ea80afef06838f9ec04af4e8f5.avif?t=1752184477\" data-has-big width=800 height=557 /></span></p>",
